/b> Vinyl is a record that you can buy at the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Monstrous_Manor\" title=\"The Monstrous Manor\">The Monstrous Manor</a> for 🍬5.600 <a href=\"/wiki/Candy\" title=\"Candy\">Candy</a>, it can be put into <a href=\"/wiki/Blue_Vinyl_Player\" title=\"Blue Vinyl Player\">Blue Vinyl Player</a> or any other Vinyl player to make it play music.\n</p><p>This is a Limited Vinyl which could only be obtained during the 2024 Halloween and the <a href=\"/wiki/2025_Halloween_Event\" title=\"2025 Halloween Event\">2025 Halloween Event</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This vinyl causes in-game environmental effect of thick red fog when played.</li>\n<li>This item can only be bought with <a href=\"/wiki/Candy\" title=\"Candy\">Candy</a> and only during Halloween.</li>\n<li>This vinyl was made by Genisis.</li>\n<li>Vinyl texture by Peekaboo.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Vinyls_Nav\" title=\"Template:Vinyls Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Vinyls_Nav\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Vinyls_Nav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"https://sta